    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠλ-ακρὶς</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾶας, ἡ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>millstone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aet.
				3.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠλακρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ,
				<i>cockroach</i> found in mills and bakehouses, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				583
			</span></i>:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠλαβρίς</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				73
			</span></i> (ap.<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>): both forms in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.180
			</span></i>.</div>
